
# KodeKloud 100 Days Of DevOps Exercises

This repository contains a collection of exercise tasks and notes for the KodeKloud ["100 Days of DevOps"](https://engineer.kodekloud.com/practice) workshop.

## Overview

This repo is a simple collection of solved tasks. Each `task-XX.md` file holds the steps taken and commands used to solve a specific problem or exercise.


